    "notes": {
      "player": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">When reroll with FP: gain an extra +10 on the reroll. May share this ebenfit with an ally within sight&communication range as reaction</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><em>You gain a +1SL Bonus whenever you re-roll a Test with a Fate Point after failing your initial attempt. You may spend a Reaction to pass this benefit to any ally spending Fate Points to re-roll a Test as long as the ally is within line of sight and communications range.</em></span></p>",
